# Copy to .env (git-ignored). Read by `make dev` / `make api`.

# SEC EDGAR requires a contact in the User-Agent of every request (fair-access policy).
# Without it the FIL function shows a configuration message; everything else works.
SEC_USER_AGENT="Tessera research you@example.com"

# ASK (AI research assistant) calls the Anthropic API. Each question costs a few cents.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY="sk-ant-..."
# Optional: the model ASK uses (default claude-opus-5-5).
# TESSERA_ASK_MODEL="claude-opus-5-5"
